# Build outputs and the SolidWorks interop assemblies are not committed:
# the DLLs ship with SolidWorks and are not ours to redistribute, and the
# .exe files are built from src/. To rebuild, copy the two assemblies out of
# your SolidWorks install and run, from this folder:
#
#   csc -out:SwExplodeConfigs.exe \
#       -r:SolidWorks.Interop.sldworks.dll -r:SolidWorks.Interop.swconst.dll \
#       src\SwExplodeConfigs.cs
#
# (csc lives in C:\Windows\Microsoft.NET\Framework64\v4.0.30319\)
*.exe
SolidWorks.Interop.*.dll
